          "code": "EDIT_EMPLOYEE_RATINGS",
          "id": "1774590191840",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774590191841_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "## INPUT DATA SOURCE\n{{$context.$nodes.GET_SELECTED_PERSON_RECORD.$output.result}}\n\n## PRESENTATION AND FORMATTING LOGIC\nTitle: 'Adjust Placement for <PersonName>'\nSubtitle/ Summary: 'Before adjusting placements, review your team's current talent distribution based on insights'\n\nProduce a recordWidget with fields {{$context.$nodes.CONSTRUCT_EDITABLE_FIELDS.$output.result}}\n\n## SYSTEM FIELDS\n- Create a system field with id \"PersonName\" and value {{$context.$nodes.GET_SELECTED_PERSON_RECORD.$output.result.PersonName}}\n- Create a system field with id \"PersonId\" and value {{$context.$nodes.GET_SELECTED_PERSON_RECORD.$output.result.PersonId}}\n- Create a system field with id \"EvaluationId\" and value {{$context.$nodes.GET_SELECTED_PERSON_RECORD.$output.result.EvaluationId}}\n- Create a system field with id \"ManagerRatingId\" and value {{$context.$nodes.GET_SELECTED_PERSON_RECORD.$output.result.ManagerRatingId}}\n- Create a system field with id \"SectionRatingsRequiredFlag\" and value {{$context.$nodes.GET_SELECTED_PERSON_RECORD.$output.result.SectionRatingsRequiredFlag}}\n- Create a system field with id \"SectionCommentsRequiredFlag\" and value {{$context.$nodes.GET_SELECTED_PERSON_RECORD.$output.result.SectionCommentsRequiredFlag}}\n- Create a system field with id \"SectionRatingsDisplayFlag\" and value {{$context.$nodes.GET_SELECTED_PERSON_RECORD.$output.result.SectionRatingsDisplayFlag}}\n- Create a system field with id \"SectionCommentsDisplayFlag\" and value {{$context.$nodes.GET_SELECTED_PERSON_RECORD.$output.result.SectionCommentsDisplayFlag}}\n\n## RULES\n- Strictly use id names as specified\n- Show exact Title and Subtitle/ Summary\n- Always show RatingDescription for the \"Performance Rating\" field and not the numeric value\n- When Submitting the form, Alway pass the numeric value of the 'Performance Rating' from organizationTargets.items for the 'newrating'"
            }
