              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate a markup content as follows:\n\n**Adjustment Completed**\nPlacement has been successfully updated. Your team's talent distribution now reflects this adjustment\n\nAdditionally, add an immediate actionable insight with followUpCommand: ora.Invoke(\"refresh\")\n\nConstraint: Provide only the requested text. Do not include any introductory text, conversational fillers, or explanations."
